    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdriftdoc-Create Hotel Rooms Hold-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Hotel Rooms Hold API enables users to temporarily reserve hotel rooms, ensuring availability for future guests. This endpoint allows hotels to manage room bookings by placing holds on specific rooms, which can later be confirmed or released as needed. Ideal for hotel managers and reservation systems, this API streamlines the room allocation process, enhancing customer satisfaction through better inventory management. Enhance your booking capabilities with efficient room hold operations to cater to fluctuating demand.",
